{"id":"alla_","lemma":"allá","pos":"adv","rank":303,"glosses":["there, over there, thither, yonder (in a direction away from the speaker and the listener)","then; back then (in time)","expressing rejection or lack of interest towards the speaker"],"ipa":"/aˈʝa/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Guergana-all%C3%A1.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Acaso él fue allá?","en":"Did he go there?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441360"},{"text":"Me voy para allá.","en":"I'm going there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586472"},{"text":"Estuve allá una vez.","en":"I was there once.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442614"},{"text":"Ellos no estaban allá.","en":"They weren't there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501362"},{"text":"Ahora voy para allá.","en":"I'm going there now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/101843"}]}